### List Tickets for Event
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tickets?eventId=66d000000000000000000001

### Create VIP Ticket Tier
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "66d000000000000000000001",
  "name": "VIP All-Access Pass",
  "description": "Includes keynote seating, VIP networking reception, and lunch.",
  "price": 499,
  "quantity": 50,
  "saleEnd": "2026-10-14T23:59:59Z",
  "benefits": ["VIP Lounge", "Speaker Dinner", "Priority Check-in"]
}
